{"id":3302,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>9月8日上午10时，机械工程学院2026年山西省研究生创新项目结题答辩在机械大楼314会议室举行。各项目答辩同学围绕课题研究内容、实验数据及成果产出作了系统汇报，展示了扎实的科研训练功底。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMmrLkozVfLl78LMmG8Uz7Doz6RLzloPo7lbU4Gao7-bMmN0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRnky4M1yinl7iMmLDUmM2LmGaUmlbUNV2UN7Znln2LRMFLzARMNlDMmMFL4nkUzlJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzLsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41137&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1CD365EA5636B3F200B59BAFBA8EDF03/18C6E663/34BA5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMNULbUmU4U49PLMN7aUmUPLlLYM4fo7MmNinRCDMRvYLRv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYnkyDL1hRn7laU4nVnlLsLmlYolrRnN-iMRTRLmL4L7rFMR94U46VMRrFoRUDM47Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzLsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41137&e=.png\"></p><p>答辩评审组就研究方案的科学性、创新点和应用价值进行提问，并提出针对性建议。同学们回应清晰，讨论深入，现场学术氛围浓厚。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUzCL4nRvsL4vZLM4lan7LbnR78MmCoDnlCaLRLbLmMkoz70gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkL1y8MYy8ozrRoRn2M7-sMlWko7CYUmn2LmlZolUiL4rFMNVRMzW7U8VFL4CanzGJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzLsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41137&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CB247495C84F4B75BB8F2B4F2589D535/6AC52DCA/360E0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gnRLLDLNlZo7lsLMR9iMzGYnmNDoR-osM8L4nz9Dol-iLl-0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfMky4oSyDM778U4W2MmM7nmrVUzCbLmC4L4NYL4MfUmQFLzCDU4rRLNWFoRU8nRlJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzLsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41137&e=.png\"></p><p>此次结题答辩既是对研究生科研产出的集中检验，也为学生后续研究提供了专业的学术指导。学院将继续依托创新项目平台，鼓励研究生深耕专业领域，持续推动高质量科研成果的产出与转化。</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMmrLkozVfLl78LMmG8Uz7Doz6RLzloPo7lbU4Gao7-bMmN0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRnky4M1yinl7iMmLDUmM2LmGaUmlbUNV2UN7Znln2LRMFLzARMNlDMmMFL4nkUzlJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UPLzLsgtA8pUucc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=41137&e=.png"}